  "description": {
   "en": "Hermes, the fourth son of the Kano family. Although he was said to be the underdog of the family, Hermes was enjoying the lazy aristocratic life, but by chance he inherited the family and became the head of the family! If he is expected and appreciated, he will no longer be able to live a leisurely life - he is afraid, so he tries to hide his abilities in every situation...!? He is loved, admired, and respected by a man who doesn't want to show his true colors, and he lives the life of the \"strongest\" head of the family as usual!",
   "ja": "カノー家の四男・ヘルメス。一族の落ちこぼれと言われながらも、ぐうたら貴族生活を満喫していたヘルメスだが、ひょんなことから家を継ぎ、当主になってしまった!!　期待され、評価されればのんびり暮らすことはできなくなる――危惧した彼は、あらゆる場面で能力を隠そうとするのだが…!?　本気なんて出したくない男の慕われ・惚れられ・尊敬される、相変わらずの“最強”当主生活！"
  },
